WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.248
TanStack Start leaves
i18n to a library,

2
00:00:04.248 --> 00:00:06.964
which resolves the locale
for each server request.

3
00:00:07.364 --> 00:00:11.369
The library reads a URL prefix
or cookie and loads the messages

4
00:00:11.369 --> 00:00:12.321
before render.

5
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:17.341
General Translation's gt-tanstack-start
translates copy written

6
00:00:17.341 --> 00:00:19.070
inline in JSX.

7
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:24.422
Register gtMiddleware
in src/start.ts,

8
00:00:24.422 --> 00:00:27.696
and it resolves the locale from
the cookie or Accept-Language.

9
00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:32.759
Or run npx gt init, and the
setup wizard makes these changes

10
00:00:32.759 --> 00:00:33.269
for you.

11
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.902
Wrap copy in the T component,

12
00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:39.419
and run npx gt translate.

13
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:42.808
Your team now ships
Spanish with each release.
